  "estimatedMinutes": 2,
  "statement": "Circle \\(O\\) has diameters \\(\\overline{AB}\\) and \\(\\overline{CD}\\) perpendicular to each other. \\(\\overline{AM}\\) is any chord intersecting \\(\\overline{CD}\\) at \\(P.\\) Then \\(AP\\cdot AM\\) is equal to:",
